# Prisma migrations

When you add or change a file under `prisma/migrations/`, apply it to the local database in the same turn with:

```bash
npx prisma migrate deploy
```

Do not wait for the user to ask. Prefer `migrate deploy` (non-interactive) over `migrate dev`. After applying, regenerate the client if the schema changed (`npm run prisma:generate`).
